OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be mostly dry with
OL,6,Fbright or sunny spells, especially
OL,7,Fover Moray and North Aberdeenshire. A
OL,8,Ffew showers in the east this morning,
OL,9,Fwhile parts of Deeside and the south
OL,10,Fwill be cloudier. Maximum Temperature
OL,11,F8C.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA mainly dry evening and
OL,14,Fnight with the best of the clear
OL,15,Fspells over Banff and Moray. Cloudier
OL,16,Fover parts of southern Aberdeenshire,
OL,17,Fthe odd shower mainly along the coast.
OL,18,FMinimum Temperature 2C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page BWeatherCReg Sport FNat Radio
