OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA mainly dry morning,
OL,6,Fbrightest in north. Then showers
OL,7,Fgradually pushing in, more frequent
OL,8,Fover Aberdeenshire, on a moderate
OL,9,Fsoutheasterly breeze. Maximum
OL,10,FTemperature 8C.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FA
OL,13,Fchangeable few days with further
OL,14,Fspells of rain spreading in from the
OL,15,FAtlantic but also some brighter drier
OL,16,Fperiods.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
